<div class="container">
<h1>3D Printer LAN File Management Enhancements</h1>

<p class="last-updated">Last Updated: 2026-10-08 | Version: 0.01 | Status: In Progress | <a href="[% c.uri_for('/project/details') %]?project_id=206">Project #206 (3DPRINT)</a> | <a href="[% c.uri_for('/todo') %]?project_id=206">Todos</a></p>

<div id="toc" class="row">
<a href="#overview" class="doc-navlink">Overview</a>
<a href="#requirements" class="doc-navlink">Requirements</a>
